    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya ea sugoocheanda was Ahasiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghami sugoocheanda was Ahabu. Hean ghaheawa fuga Moabu goombal saawa fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'adaan Ahasiya aba seawadeeda mida jeeda ghooriidaanyi sideeksa uhuumba nuut, ea gwasawana muuchi, nea abeeda gwanda ng'eanyiida Samariya. Ng'ata goojeakta buuneeda nea gwayeesha, “Aweayeena oanyaasha Baal-sebubu was aseeta Ekroni, gideaba geeyooni gayghoabuudani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Eliya was sibaneeda ng'eanyiida Dishbi, “Ng'eada una nyeascheewana fugiga ajeakta sugoocheanda Samariyahiin ak giyeeshi, ‘Heapi nih gwasin gideaba manda ASEETA jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli? Ea aweayeena eanyaasha Baal-sebubu was aseeta Ekroni?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Mwayrarang'aanana uhuuda bulaliida idiyeesi aba huumwa gaymeawa.’” Ak ghang'eat Eliya gawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta fuga gwachi siicheakta heeda Sugoocheanda. Ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda noobiigu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeesha niny, “Geeroonyeewi sih ak gwayeeshiineasa, ‘Abiikta heeda sugoocheanda ajeakneagwean. Ak gooyeeshi gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, heapi nih gwasin gideaba manda ASEETA aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli? Bwak ea aweayeena eanyaasha Baal-sebubu was aseeta Ekroni? Asi aba badaydeaba nih. Mwayrarang'aanana uhuuda bulaliida iding'di aba huumwa gaymeawa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Siidida ooroonyeewi ak gwarukuneegwa ng'asheesuun siida uurjiini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geasha ak geeyeesha, “Siida gookwa hang'da buudeega, nea gwarasa manandaanyi ghealooda sisina muunda.” Gwayeesha, “Abeeda siisi ea Eliyaheeda ng'eanyiida Dishbi gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta sugoocheanda shirikarajeanda haw ambal lugooda. Sea fih haradam ea damanamughuush. Ak geeweesa Eliya hean geahita nea goopteada aba uhuuda heayeeda. Hean geeyeesha “Ea orjeeda siida ASEETA gwayi sugoocheanda, ‘rarang'aana.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Eliya ak gwayeesha. Shirikarajeanda haw mida madeeda lugooda fih haradam ea damanamughuushiin “Inyas ghaawaschi siida ASEETA dararang'aana beasta leabu humng'eeda ak ghwaaknyi ang'iing'i ea fugaagu as haradam ea damanamughuush.” Ng'ata ghwararang'aan beasta ak ghwaak niny ea fugaaschi as haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta gicha sugoocheanda shirikarajeanda haw mida madeeda lugooda, ea fugaaschi as haradam ea damanamughuush ak geeweesa, Ak geeyeesha “Ea orjeeda siida ASEETA, gwayi sugoocheanda, ‘rarang'aana nea gilamwajaani!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Eliya ak ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “inyas ghaawaschi siida ASEETA, dararang'aana beasta leabu humng'eeda, ak ghwaaknyi ea fugaagu as haradam ea damanamughuush.” Hean ghwararang'aan beasta ASEETA leabu humng'eeda ak ghwaak niny ea fugaaschi as haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta gicha niba samwagu sugoocheanda shirikarajeanda mida madeeda lugooda, sea fih haradam ea damanamughuush, hean gawa siidida haw mida madeeda lugoodean bea samwaguun, ea fih haradam ea damanamughuush. Ng'ata ghwascheang'da ea mwahita ghang'uda ng'eanyi gutung'weaka aba madeeda Eliya ak ghamearmear muuchi nea gwayeesha. “Ea orjeeda siida ASEETA geamuscheey gideaba gurooroodeanyu ea gurooruunatkeaba fiisu ikaagu bea gadiyeedean was haradam ea damanamughuushiin aghuuha eaweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula ghwararang'aan beasta leabu humng'eeda ak ghwaak ghwanung' goosha fugiga hees mida madeeda lugooda bea iyeenyean sea fuga nyaawa as haradam ea damanamughuushiin. Ak ghamneawa geamuscheeweey aghuuha gurooroodeanyu aba madeadaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Eliya, “Rarang'aada sea niny adiiwali niny.” Hean ghang'eat ak ghwararang'aada nea goodeayi ea ghwahita heeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA ‘Aba gideaba giijeakti buuneeda heeda Baal-sebubu was aseeta Ekroni, heapi nih gwasin gideaba ASEETA aba jeeda Israeli mandana? Gwachi jea abearsiina ng'asheanda. Asi mayrarang'anana badayda bulaliida iding'di aba huumwa gaymeawa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghami aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA rugu Eliya, ak goombaliischi Yoram aba gweaydeaba iyeenya bea Yehoramu orjeeda Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda; aba gideaba niny mandeawana baleanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak haleanjeeda sean abit sin Ahasiya ea miyeeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
